---
title: Sort the job feed by how well it matches your skills
date: 2026-08-28
summary: A new Best match sort orders the whole catalogue by what share of a job's skills you already have — full matches first, then progressively deeper. No AI, no credits, and it works with every filter.
type: changelog
tags:
